        "with the first dark port D1 = A, C = D1^T D2 has C C^T = 112500 P_A4: four equal squared principal cosines "
        "112500/(600 x 7200) = 5/192, so the two span 8 dimensions. The mixed moments are D1^T Delta D2 = 232 C and "
